 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！东西有高有矮，有厚有薄，有多有少。今天，我们来比一比！"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:tall",
    "focus:tall"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "爸爸个子高高的："
    },
    {
     "en": "tall"
    },
    {
     "en": "Dad is tall."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:short",
    "edge:tall>short",
    "focus:short"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "我个子矮矮的："
    },
    {
     "en": "short"
    },
    {
     "en": "I am short."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:long",
    "edge:short>long",
    "focus:long"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "这个词还有一个意思：短。短的反面，是长："
    },
    {
     "en": "long"
    },
    {
     "zh": "长颈鹿的脖子长长的："
    },
    {
     "en": "The giraffe has a long neck."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:tall,short,long"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "记住哦：人的个子，用高和矮；东西的长度，用长和短。"
    },
    {
     "en": "tall, short",
     "cue": [
      "focus:tall,short"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "long, short",
     "cue": [
      "focus:long,short"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:straight",
    "focus:straight"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "尺子的边，是笔直笔直的："
    },
    {
     "en": "straight"
    },
    {
     "zh": "中间的 g h，又不发音了。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:inch",
    "edge:straight>inch",
    "focus:inch"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "用尺子量一量。尺子上的一小段，是一英寸，差不多是你大拇指那么宽："
    },
    {
     "en": "inch"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:thick",
    "focus:thick"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "词典厚厚的："
    },
    {
     "en": "thick"
    },
    {
     "zh": "开头的 t h，舌尖放在牙齿中间。"
    },
    {
     "en": "a thick book"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:thin",
    "edge:thick>thin",
    "focus:thin"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "作业本薄薄的："
    },
    {
     "en": "thin"
    },
    {
     "en": "a thin book"
    },
    {
     "zh": "说一个人很瘦，也可以用这个词。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:lot",
    "focus:lot"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "爆米花装了满满一桶，好多好多："
    },
    {
     "en": "a lot"
    },
    {
     "en": "a lot of popcorn"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:much",
    "edge:lot>much",
    "focus:much"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "牛奶、水这样数不清的东西，问有多少，要用"
    },
    {
     "en": "much"
    },
    {
     "en": "How much milk do you want?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:weigh",
    "focus:weigh"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "东西有多重，放在秤上称一称："
    },
    {
     "en": "weigh"
    },
    {
     "zh": "它的名词是重量：",
     "cue": [
      "alt:weigh"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "weight"
    },
    {
     "zh": "这两个词里，g h 都不发音。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:half",
    "focus:half"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "一个披萨，从中间切一刀，每份是一半："
    },
    {
     "en": "half"
    },
    {
     "zh": "小提示：l 不发音。"
    },
    {
     "en": "half a pizza"
